{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic survival-horror gameplay meets open-world exploration</strong> in this single-player, atmospheric, first-person adventure. <br><strong></strong><br><strong>Explore and uncover the deep mysteries of <i>Veilmoor Isl</i></strong><i>e</i>, an eerie secluded island shrouded in secrecy and rumor. <br>All alone, you must use your wits while searching every corner of the island's various structures to <strong>gather</strong> <strong>key items, precious resources, information and relics</strong> needed to <strong>solve puzzles and unlock pathways</strong> toward your great discovery.\u00a0<strong>Resources are scarce</strong>, use them wisely or your chances of survival will quickly diminish.\u00a0<strong>Your means of defense are limited</strong> and the few enemies you encounter are extremely dangerous, they should be avoided at all costs.<strong>\u00a0The choices you make will determine your ultimate fate</strong>.<br><br><i><strong>Code of Corruption</strong></i> is the debut title created by <strong>Polymath Digital Studio</strong>, a one-man studio along with various contributing artists and developers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513410?t=1771453681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771453681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513410/37e7ec77be87e755f5d9b0311b59e6fb741c47f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771453681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513410/37e7ec77be87e755f5d9b0311b59e6fb741c47f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771453681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descr